--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,45 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Subscribes a device to push notifications, so everything that lands in the notification tray is pushed to it as well. The values come from the subscription the browser gets from its push service. You can only subscribe your own devices.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The push service URL that notifications are posted to |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's public key |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's auth secret |
+
+Subscribing the same endpoint again refreshes its keys instead of adding a second subscription.
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/subscriptions/2sd8fj2",
+    "p256dh_key": "BNcRdreALRFXTkOOUHK1EtK2wtaz5Ry4YfYCA_0QTpQtUbVlUls0VJXg7A8u-Ts1XbjhazAkj7I99e8QcYP7DkM=",
+    "auth_key": "tBHItJI5svbpez7KI4CCXg=="
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2"
+}
+```
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Unsubscribes a device.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
